  (text "The TVS is intended to clamp input spikes; the capacitors supply short local current pulses.\nThese parts support the 2S protection circuit on f01. The protected output goes to Burrito through f03.\nCroi measures its own current, so Churro does not add another avionics-current shunt."
    (at 15.24 22.86 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "77876232-3adf-4353-a374-f2f4c9c6e7fd")))
